# INVOL option 8 on a DS5500: create the OS paging file.
#
# **The create path.** The menu says "create *or modify*", and on a volume that
# already has a paging file INVOL asks `Do you wish to change its size?` before
# the size -- so this script cannot be reused to correct one.
#
# **1000, not the DN3500's 640.** This machine publishes `default value = 1000`;
# taking another machine's default is what a script copied from C50 does.
expect MD14
expect >
send DI C\r
expect >
send EX INVOL\r
expect Option:
send 8\r
expect q=Quit
send w\r
expect logical volume number
send 1\r
expect paging file
send 1000\r
expect Anything more to do
send n\r
